<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Knoll Inc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Knoll Inc started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage at Knoll Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley served as an underwriter of Knoll's May 9 initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Knoll makes office systems and business furniture.</p>
</text>
